{
  "_comment": "Declarative UI layout for the voxel-cluster front-end. The host parses this and exposes it to Lua as the `UI` global (flicker-script ScriptHost::set_global_json); scripts read named elements from it and emit draw commands. Edit values here to move/resize/restyle the UI, then relaunch. Colors are RGBA 0..1; positions/sizes are HUD pixels. `texture` names resolve through the `Textures` global (name -> engine texture id). `modal` is a shared component style; `screens.*` are its instances (selected by Model.screen). hud/logo/loading are their own screens.",

